                <UserObject event_date="1814-03-16" event_end_date="1814-03-24" date_label="16-24 March 1814 (9 days)" location="Ship rations" name_as_recorded="Demel, Lewen" evidence_type="Named entry and battalion affidavit" source_shape_ids="[&quot;volume10&quot;]" source_files="[&quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7088/P1070654.JPG&quot;, &quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7088/P1070699.JPG&quot;, &quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7088/P1070700.JPG&quot;, &quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7088/P1070702.JPG&quot;]" link="primary_sources/WO_12-7088/P1070654.JPG" citation="Levi: P1070654, entry 193, As No 5; P1070699 entry 5, detail P1070700, ship rations from 16 March, 9 days. P1070702: battalion at sea 24 March. No specific ship or departure port is named." label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px;line-height:25px&quot;&gt;16-24 March 1814 (9 days)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ship rations&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px;line-height:25px&quot;&gt;Demel, Lewen&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;His entry&amp;#x27;s &amp;quot;As No 5&amp;quot; reference applies the ship-ration note &amp;quot;from 16 March&amp;quot;: 9 days through 24 March. The battalion&amp;#x27;s quarter-end affidavit explicitly records it at sea on 24 March.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;primary_sources/WO_12-7088/P1070654.JPG&quot;&gt;WO 12/7088&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tooltip="Levi: P1070654, entry 193, As No 5; P1070699 entry 5, detail P1070700, ship rations from 16 March, 9 days. P1070702: battalion at sea 24 March. No specific ship or departure port is named.&#xa;&#xa;Supporting files:&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7088/P1070654.JPG&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7088/P1070699.JPG&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7088/P1070700.JPG&#xa;primary_sources/WO_12-7088/P1070702.JPG" id="event-march-ship">
